# Build context hygiene: dependencies are installed and outputs built inside
# the image; local state, data and docs never belong in it.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
apps/server/data
data
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.mmdb
docs
mockups
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
# Tests, their outputs and agent worktrees: the build compiles only sources.
**/test
**/*.test.ts
test-results
playwright-report
.claude
